"@@home_6@@\">@@home_7@@</a><a href=\"@@home_8@@\">@@home_9@@</a><a class=\"contact\" href=\"@@home_10@@\">@@home_11@@ <span>@@home_12@@</span></a></nav></header><main><div class=\"hero\"><img src=\"@@home_13@@\" alt=\"Jamili e Cristian — filme de casamento em Itamambuca\"><div class=\"hero-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"dot\"></i> @@home_14@@</div><h1>@@home_15@@<br>@@home_16@@ <em>@@home_17@@</em></h1><div class=\"hero-bottom\"><div><p>@@home_18@@<br>@@home_19@@</p><a class=\"pill\" href=\"@@home_4@@\">@@home_20@@ <span>@@home_12@@</span></a></div><div class=\"hero-note\">@@home_21@@</div></div></div></div><div class=\"ticker\"><span>@@home_22@@</span><span>@@home_23@@ &nbsp; @@home_24@@ &nbsp; @@home_25@@ &nbsp; @@home_24@@ &nbsp; @@home_26@@</span><span>@@home_27@@</span></div><section id=\"filmes\"><div class=\"section-top\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"dot\"></i> @@home_28@@</div><h2>@@home_29@@</h2></div><div class=\"filters\" aria-label=\"Filtrar filmes\"><button class=\"filter active\" data-filter=\"all\">@@home_30@@</button><button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"film\">@@home_31@@</button><button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"series\">@@home_32@@</button></div></div><div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></div><p class=\"demo\">@@home_33@@</p></section><section class=\"manifest\" id=\"olhar\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"dot\"></i> @@home_7@@</div><div><h2>@@home_34@@<br>@@home_35@@ <em style=\"font-family:Georgia\">@@home_36@@</em></h2><p>@@home_37@@</p><p>@@home_38@@</p><p>@@home_39@@</p></div></section><section id=\"contato\" class=\"end\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"dot\"></i> @@home_40@@</div><h2>@@home_41@@<br>@@home_42@@</h2></div><a class=\"pill\" href=\"https://wa.me/5512988274244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@@home_43@@ <span>@@home_12@@</span></a></section></main><footer><span>@@home_44@@ <span id=\"year\"></span> @@home_45@@</span><span>@@home_46@@</span><a href=\"@@home_1@@\">@@home_47@@</a></footer><dialo